**`dec_counter` double-lock pattern is fragile** — The `drop(entry)` / `map.remove(key)` sequence avoids a DashMap deadlock but is easy to break during future edits. Consider using `saturating_sub`:
```rust
if let Some(mut count) = map.get_mut(key) {
    *count = count.saturating_sub(1);
}
```

