**Resize JSON via string formatting is fragile** — `format!("{{\"cols\":{},\"rows\":{}}}", cols, rows)` uses manually-escaped braces. Use fully structured JSON instead:
```rust
let pty_inner = serde_json::json!({"cols": cols, "rows": rows});
let resize_msg = serde_json::json!({
    "event": { "data": { "pty": base64_encode(&pty_inner.to_string()) } }
});
```

